  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://v.blakesmods.com/banners/cucumber?source=curseforge\" width=\"840\" height=\"168\"></p>\n<p style=\"display:flex;text-align:center\"><a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fcucumber\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/cucumber/downloads&style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fcucumber\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/cucumber/version&style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fcucumber\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://api.blakesmods.com/v2/badges/cucumber/mc_version&style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a style=\"margin-right:8px\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fdocs%252fcucumber\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=docs&message=view&color=brightgreen&style=for-the-badge\"> </a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fblakesmods.com%252fwiki%252fcucumber\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=wiki&message=view&color=brightgreen&style=for-the-badge\"> </a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Cucumber — это мод, содержащий общий код и функциональность, используемые в моих других модах.</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#999\"><strong>Возможности</strong></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Добавляет всплывающие подсказки для блоков и предметов, перечисляющие их теги при включённых расширенных подсказках.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Добавляет всплывающие подсказки для предметов, отображающие их NBT при включённых расширенных подсказках. (отключено по умолчанию)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#999\"><strong>Мои моды</strong></span><span style=\"color:#008000;font-size:24px\"><br></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-agriculture\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mystical Agriculture<br></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-agradditions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mystical Agradditions<br></a></span></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-automation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Mystical Automation</span></a></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mystical-customization\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mystical Customization</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extended-crafting\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extended Crafting<br></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pickle-tweaks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pickle Tweaks<br></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/iron-jetpacks\" rel=\"nofollow\">Iron Jetpacks<br></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/more-buckets\" rel=\"nofollow\">More Buckets</a></span></li>\n</ul>",
